{"verse_key": "10:58", "surah": 10, "verse": 58, "text_uthmani": "قُلْ بِفَضْلِ ٱللَّهِ وَبِرَحْمَتِهِۦ فَبِذَٰلِكَ فَلْيَفْرَحُوا۟ هُوَ خَيْرٌ مِّمَّا يَجْمَعُونَ", "translation": "Say, \"In the bounty of Allāh and in His mercy - in that let them rejoice; it is better than what they accumulate.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1315090, "verse_to_ms": 1328460, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 1315090, "end_ms": 1315710}, {"i": 1, "text": "بِفَضْلِ", "start_ms": 1315710, "end_ms": 1316840}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 1316840, "end_ms": 1317410}, {"i": 3, "text": "وَبِرَحْمَتِهِۦ", "start_ms": 1317410, "end_ms": 1318970}, {"i": 4, "text": "فَبِذَٰلِكَ", "start_ms": 1318970, "end_ms": 1320260}, {"i": 5, "text": "فَلْيَفْرَحُوا۟", "start_ms": 1320260, "end_ms": 1321730}, {"i": 6, "text": "هُوَ", "start_ms": 1321730, "end_ms": 1322040}, {"i": 7, "text": "خَيْرٌ", "start_ms": 1322040, "end_ms": 1322760}, {"i": 8, "text": "مِّمَّا", "start_ms": 1322760, "end_ms": 1324870}, {"i": 9, "text": "يَجْمَعُونَ", "start_ms": 1324870, "end_ms": 1327955}]}